  unitName: Robot Maniac Heins
  unitId: 30415
  unitNumber: 1288
  description: As the party entered Ishgria, Heins followed the captain's orders
    to scout Rakshult alone. There, he found a number of facilities that operated
    on otherworldly technology. Leaving the fighting to Zenas, Heins was absorbed
    in investigation when he was accosted by a demon, who demanded to know the purpose
    of the expeditionary force's mission. Moments after Heins replied, the facility
    became the scene of a fierce battle. When the fires at last died out, the only
    identifiable remains were the shattered husk of an automaton.
  summonDesc: I can never forgive the demon that destroyed my Zenas! Yet...its existence
    intrigues me.
  fusionDesc: Zenas grows stronger yet!<br>What shall we destroy next?<br>No living
    thing can defy us!
  evoDesc: Behold my Zenas!<br>Even the demons are no match for this destructive
    power!
  element: 3
  rarity: 5
